# Operation Team

## Description

The Operation Team is responsible for managing and coordinating the operational activities of the project.

### Responsibilities

- Manage project operations and workflow
- Coordinate tasks among team members
- Track project progress
- Identify and resolve operational issues
- Ensure tasks are completed on time
- Maintain proper project documentation

### Branch

`operation`

### Team Goal

To ensure smooth coordination, efficient task management, and successful completion of the project.
